Z||000000||Drako||10-28-1999||01:10 PM||||I was wondering if any of you could direct me <BR>to a site or company that sells turbo parts <BR>for the 4.3..... I bought one last week that needs to be rebuilt but I got a great deal on it. There were no major problems with it and I yanked it from a 89 s-10 blazer in a junk yard that was recentally totaled in the rear end colllision. I ended up paying $250 for the whole engine with the tranny. It has 150k miles on it. <BR>	My main question is, this is the engine that was used in the typhoon isn't it? I was under the impression the typhoon was just a 4.3l blazer with turbo, a forge crank, lower compression ratios..ect. That engine from the typhoon is hard to find if you can even find one so, is it possible to modify the normal 4.3 into the type of engine the typhoon had? Im guessing it is, I just need to find a company that sells performace parts for it.....Thanks in advance.<P>Drako (Roy)<BR>1988 Gt Yellow, Stock v6 5spd<BR>1984 Viper Red Custom, In the process of getting a 63 buick v8.<BR>1986 Gt Blue, v6....mostly likely will end up with a 4.3 turbo.<P>||||reg||14
